e a button and change it with appropriate styles. Learn more: https://github.com/jsx-eslint/eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y/blob/HEAD/docs/rules/anchor-is-valid.md","jsx-a11y/anchor-has-content","Anchors must have content and the content must be accessible by a screen reader.","'aio' is defined but never used.","'bookingapp' is defined but never used.","'cityaddis' is defined but never used.","Imported JSX component Projects_header must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","Imported JSX component Projects_content must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","Imported JSX component Projects_colab must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","Imported JSX component Projects_footer must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","'FontAwesomeIcon' is defined but never used.","jsx-a11y/alt-text","img elements must have an alt prop, either with meaningful text, or an empty string for decorative images.","Imported JSX component Skills_header must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","Imported JSX component Skills_item must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","The href attribute is required for an anchor to be keyboard accessible. Provide a valid, navigable address as the href value. If you cannot provide an href, but still need the element to resemble a link, use a button and change it with appropriate styles. Learn more: https://github.com/jsx-eslint/eslint-plugin-jsx-a11y/blob/HEAD/docs/rules/anchor-is-valid.md","'useState' is defined but never used.","'useEffect' is defined but never used.","'id' is assigned a value but never used.","Imported JSX component Projects_line must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","'login' is defined but never used.","'eat' is defined but never used.","Imported JSX component Colab_works must be in PascalCase or SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE","eqeqeq","Expected '===' and instead saw '=='.","BinaryExpression","unexpected","'height' is defined but never used.","'data' is assigned a value but never used."]